  "comment": "Referensi: http://wiki.squid-cache.org/Features/HTTPS When a browser comes across an https:// URL, it does one of two things: opens an SSL/TLS connection directly to the origin server or opens a TCP tunnel through Squid to the origin server using the CONNECT request method. Squid interaction with these two traffic types is discussed below. Contents 1 CONNECT tunnel 2 CONNECT tunnel through Squid",
